---
import BaseLayout from '@/layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import { COMPANY } from '@/data/company';
---

<BaseLayout title="Investor Overview" description="ELG's public investor overview: how project delivery builds reusable engineering capability and future platform opportunities.">
  <section class="relative overflow-hidden border-b border-brand-line bg-brand-coal text-white">
    <div class="absolute inset-0 opacity-20 [background-image:linear-gradient(to_right,rgb(255_255_255/0.12)_1px,transparent_1px),linear-gradient(to_bottom,rgb(255_255_255/0.12)_1px,transparent_1px)] [background-size:72px_72px]" aria-hidden="true"></div>
    <div class="relative mx-auto max-w-7xl px-4 pb-20 pt-28 sm:px-6 sm:pb-28">
      <p class="font-mono text-[11px] font-semibold uppercase tracking-[0.2em] text-brand-orange">Investor overview</p>
      <h1 class="mt-5 max-w-5xl text-balance text-5xl font-semibold leading-[0.98] tracking-[-0.04em] sm:text-7xl">From projects to reusable capability.</h1>
      <p class="mt-6 max-w-2xl text-lg leading-relaxed text-neutral-300">Customer-specific engineering strengthens knowledge, infrastructure, and future platform opportunities.</p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="bg-white">
    <div class="mx-auto grid max-w-7xl gap-10 px-4 py-20 sm:px-6 sm:py-28 lg:grid-cols-12">
      <div class="lg:col-span-5"><h2 class="text-4xl font-semibold leading-[1.03] tracking-[-0.035em] text-brand-ink sm:text-5xl">The system problem.</h2></div>
      <div class="space-y-5 text-lg leading-relaxed text-neutral-600 lg:col-span-7"><p>Difficult operating problems cross equipment, embedded computing, connectivity, software, data, and human workflows. The costly gaps appear where those disciplines meet.</p><p>ELG works across those boundaries, from custom electronics and embedded systems through operational software, deployment, and training.</p></div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="bg-brand-paper">
    <div class="mx-auto max-w-7xl px-4 py-20 sm:px-6 sm:py-28">
      <h2 class="max-w-3xl text-balance text-4xl font-semibold leading-[1.03] tracking-[-0.035em] text-brand-ink sm:text-6xl">Three clear horizons.</h2>
      <div class="mt-12 grid gap-px overflow-hidden rounded-2xl border border-brand-line bg-brand-line md:grid-cols-3">
        <article class="bg-white p-7"><p class="font-mono text-[10px] font-bold text-brand-ember">01 / TODAY</p><h3 class="mt-7 text-2xl font-semibold">Deliver</h3><p class="mt-3 leading-relaxed text-neutral-600">Documented engineering capability across physical and digital system layers.</p></article>
        <article class="bg-white p-7"><p class="font-mono text-[10px] font-bold text-brand-ember">02 / BUILDING</p><h3 class="mt-7 text-2xl font-semibold">Compound</h3><p class="mt-3 leading-relaxed text-neutral-600">Reusable knowledge, architecture patterns, components, processes, and technical infrastructure.</p></article>
        <article class="bg-brand-orange p-7 text-white"><p class="font-mono text-[10px] font-bold text-white">03 / AMBITION</p><h3 class="mt-7 text-2xl font-semibold">Scale</h3><p class="mt-3 leading-relaxed text-white/90">Platform opportunities developed from repeated and evidenced system needs.</p></article>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="bg-white">
    <div class="mx-auto max-w-7xl px-4 py-20 sm:px-6 sm:py-28">
      <div class="max-w-3xl"><p class="font-mono text-[11px] font-semibold uppercase tracking-[0.2em] text-neutral-600">The leverage thesis</p><h2 class="mt-4 text-balance text-4xl font-semibold leading-[1.03] tracking-[-0.035em] text-brand-ink sm:text-6xl">Tailored outside. Reusable inside.</h2><p class="mt-5 text-lg leading-relaxed text-neutral-600">Customer-facing systems remain specific. Beneath them, ELG compounds architecture, embedded foundations, connectivity, diagnostics, testing, documentation, and field learning.</p></div>
      <ol class="mt-12 grid gap-3 sm:grid-cols-4">
        {['Project', 'Knowledge', 'Infrastructure', 'Platform opportunity'].map((item, index) => <li class="relative rounded-xl border border-brand-line bg-brand-paper p-5"><p class="font-mono text-[10px] text-brand-ember">0{index + 1}</p><p class="mt-5 font-semibold text-brand-ink">{item}</p>{index < 3 && <span class="absolute -right-2.5 top-1/2 z-10 hidden size-5 -translate-y-1/2 place-items-center rounded-full border border-brand-line bg-white text-xs sm:grid" aria-hidden="true">→</span>}</li>)}
      </ol>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="bg-brand-coal text-white">
    <div class="mx-auto grid max-w-7xl gap-10 px-4 py-20 sm:px-6 sm:py-24 lg:grid-cols-12 lg:items-center">
      <div class="lg:col-span-7"><p class="font-mono text-[11px] font-semibold uppercase tracking-[0.2em] text-brand-orange">Controlled disclosure</p><h2 class="mt-4 text-4xl font-semibold tracking-[-0.03em] sm:text-5xl">Evidence before assertion.</h2><p class="mt-5 max-w-2xl leading-relaxed text-neutral-400">Financial, contractual, customer, legal, and sensitive technical information belongs in a controlled diligence process, not on the public website.</p></div>
      <div class="lg:col-span-5 lg:text-right"><a href={`mailto:${COMPANY.email}?subject=Investor%20materials%20request`} class="inline-flex min-h-11 items-center rounded-full bg-brand-orange px-7 py-3.5 text-sm font-semibold text-white transition hover:-translate-y-px hover:bg-brand-ember active:scale-[0.98]">Request investor materials</a></div>
    </div>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>
